Dear Richard:

Here is a little function that I wrote to produce a
square root of a matrix.  

dar3 <- function(x)
{
        x1 <- eigen(x)
        if(any(x1$values) < 0)
                stop("Negative Eigenvalues")
        x1e <- diag(x1$values)
        x1e <- sqrt(x1e)
        u1 <- cbind(x1$vectors)
