but these were not immediately successful. If we can find a solution that
requires only replacement of help files, we will post it immediately to the
S-PLUS Web site, http://www.mathsoft.com/splus.

In the meantime, please be aware that this problem affects only the Full
Text Search capability of the Find tab; you can still access help as usual
via the Contents tab, the Index tab, and the normal S-PLUS commands (F1, ?,
help, and Help buttons). 

